2.  Demographic characteristics
2.1.   Population count
The total population for Tuvalu, as observed on 12 December 2022, was 10,643. This included 
10,632 residents and 11 non-residents. However, the count excludes people living outside 
Tuvalu at the time in which the census was conducted. A total of 54 residents were residing in 
institutions during the census. Institutions included quarantine centres, workers’ barracks, guest 
houses, correctional centres and other facilities.
