4.4.   Access to information and communications technologies
As expected, 6 out of every 10 residents who have internet access live in Funafuti. This is likely 
because the 4G mobile network is only available in Funafuti, and coverage was only extended 
to Vaitupu in 2022. Further, the observed difference in internet access could reflect the country’s 
population distribution: About 64% of the enumerated population also live in Funafuti, with the 
